graph TD
    A[Cytokinesis Complete] --> B[G1 Phase Entry]
    B --> C[Cyclin D Synthesis]
    C --> D[CDK4/6 Activation]
    D --> E[Rb Phosphorylation]
    E --> F[E2F Release]
    F --> G[G1/S Gene Expression]
    G --> H[Cell Cycle Progression]
    
    %% Alternative exit pathway
    A --> I[Quiescence Induction]
    I --> J[Cyclin Expression Downregulation]
    J --> K[CDK Inhibition]
    K --> L[Cell Cycle Arrest]
    L --> M[G0 Phase Entry]
    M --> N[Quiescence Maintenance]
    
    %% Stress response
    N --> O{Stress Conditions?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Stress Response Activation]
    P --> Q[Cell Cycle Arrest]
    Q --> R[Stress Adaptation]
    R --> S[Recovery or Apoptosis]
    
    O -->|No| T[Quiescence Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    U[Cyclin D] --> C
    V[CDK4] --> D
    W[CDK6] --> D
    X[Rb] --> E
    Y[E2F] --> F
    Z[p21] --> K
    AA[p27] --> K
    BB[p53] --> P
    
